## Inherited attempt-2 wave-2 spec — resolved, not dispatched

`.ufo/waves/round-89/w2-spec.json`, `w2-dispatch.json` (10 spawn lanes, a
written `swarm-registry.json`, empty `w2-validate.err`) were authored by
attempt 2 and never dispatched: no `w2.ready` exists and no seat ran. Attempt 3
discards them (untracked files removed; nothing from the spec is committed or
cited as evidence) because the run-15 round shape is ONE v1 wave of 8-16 seats
and w1 already carries 12: a 10-seat second wave would put the round at 22
seats, outside the band, and policy v1's wave floor (8 spawn lanes) refuses a
<=4-seat residual. The round total therefore stays 12.
